				""
				"Same goes for allays, so prioritize them!"
				""
				"They can also be destroyed by attacking the bullets, just make sure you do this so neither the allays, or the boss can hit you and get you killed."
				""
				"Defeating this boss will unlock a powerful new arsenal of weapons, access to core enchanting mechanics, and the key to &bDiamond&r crafting."
				""
				"&cImportant:&r Be sure to bring bucket of water to mitigate fall damage, or bunny hoppers, or even any curios that have fall damage negation."
